{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweetie Candy Maze: Green Apple \u2014 is a colorful and fun maze game set in a world of juicy green apple candies and sweet surprises. Collect all the sweets and find your way to the caramel portal to complete each level.<br><br>Each new maze brings more challenge and excitement as you explore deeper into the candy world!<br><br>In Sweetie Candy Maze: Green Apple:<br><br>\u2022 50 levels of candy-filled fun<br>\u2022 Bright and tasty visuals<br>\u2022 Gradually increasing difficulty<br>\u2022 Addictive and cheerful gameplay<br>\u2022 Relaxing music<br>\u2022 Achievements<br>\u2022 Simple controls<br><br>Use Gamepads (Xbox One or Xbox 360), or keyboard (WASD or arrow keys) to navigate through the different mazes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955120/extras/979feb5a292ca871f5c5ff29a79600c4.poster.avif?t=1759968424\" width=75 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955120/extras/979feb5a292ca871f5c5ff29a79600c4.webm?t=1759968424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955120/extras/6cb1ffb9cf3fb39d7246e8505587e975.poster.avif?t=1759968424\" width=75 height=69 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955120/extras/6cb1ffb9cf3fb39d7246e8505587e975.webm?t=1759968424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955120/extras/607437e20a56efa1394b5f6fbaa3a442.poster.avif?t=1759968424\" width=75 hei